# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 脚本除外。
# 这样 Windows 上开发、Linux 上 CI 构建，diff 不会因为 CRLF 全是噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做任何转换
*.jar   binary
*.jks   binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.so    binary

# 生成物不参与 diff 统计
*.md    linguist-documentation
docs/* linguist-documentation
